// the match is certain:
// - Each episode's free-roam tracks are the only 5-channel VPKs (stems: id 0 sneak, 1 normal, 2 alert). The soundtrack
//   lists them as "<place>" / "<place> Fight" pairs of the same length (the rip of the normal and the alert stem).
//   Within an episode there are exactly as many 5-channel tracks as pairs, and the worlds that list them (the hub, or the
//   interiors) say which pair is which. Ep 7's two (3, 4) are left: "North" and "Sawmill" are both its places.
// - Length agrees where it can be checked: the rip is the intro plus 2 or 3 loops (+0..12 s): Paris 0:14.9 + 2 x 82.0
//   = 2:59 (the soundtrack's 2:59), Episode Menu 0:07.7 + 2 x 36.9 = 1:22 (1:22), Contessa's Castle 4.2 + 3 x 94.4
