//   11.9 + 3 x 82.0 = 4:18 (Fight 4:16), Arpeggio's Airship 4:41 (4:50), Clock-La Battle 3:08 (3:15).
// - The single-stem tracks (id 5: jobs, chases, bosses, operations) keep the name of the place that lists them: the
//   rip's loop counts vary, so their lengths match several titles each, and by ear they are unverified.
